                "text": "This week, leading up to #VeteransDay, I had the joy of sitting down with Gary Hagen, a Vietnam Dustoff Crew Chief. The Dustoff Crew transported the wounded safely to aid stations & hospitals, & no doubt saved many, many lives. His story is awe-inspiring. Thanks for coming by! https://t.co/SGoHpUSxlv",
