                "text": "A 'Rural Emergency Hospital' designation can be a lifeline for rural communities, including those in Mississippi, but the program needs improvement. I\u2019ve reintroduced my legislation to expand access, allowing more at-risk or closed rural hospitals to provide essential emergency outpatient care.\n\nDetails: https://t.co/FBq76cJG5h",
